      "description": "Add proteins to QD solution in a quartz cuvette while stirring; measure fluorescence with a liquid-N2-cooled InGaAs OMA V detector, 15 cm focal-length SpectraPro 2150i monochromator and 632.8 nm HeNe excitation. Exact volumes, stirring speed and assay temperature are not reported. BSA, streptavidin, proteinase K and lysozyme do not significantly change PL during the <10 min observation period; the plotted Figure 2 concentration series are retained as source graphics without digitizing individual values. Figure S5 protein absorption uses 0.3 µM thrombin and 3 µM PSA, BSA, lysozyme and proteinase K, not identical conditions to the PL control series.",
